{
    "title": "GPS Route Maps & Navigation",
    "description": "GPS Route Maps & Navigation is a simple app provided with a lot of other options. Now you can easily find directions of your path from one place to another place by clicking on the places of the map, get traffic alerts, you may also get the navigation with voice commands.\r\n\r\nIf you are in such a place that you are unaware about it and not to bother just simply our app will provides you the current address. Every routes are far away from you on a distance of single tap. You can find your easiest and fastest route between two places. You have to enter your source and destinations. \r\n\r\nGet the fastest way to reach destination and save time by following the traffic updates. It helps you to get the accurate traffic updates. You can find the navigation directions with different compass views. You can calculate area by tapping on the map for certain area, get different modes of compass with navigations.\r\n\r\nYou can explore various neighborly places on Map like Schools ,Airports, Restaurants, Hospitals, Fuel Stations, Theaters and many more. You can also see neighborly place and location details.\r\n\r\nGPS Route Maps & Navigation provides the following features:\r\n\r\n* Get the address of any place simply with a click\r\n* Follow traffic alerts to avoid heavy routes\r\n* Find the directions by clicking on two different points on map\r\n* See the navigation with voice commands from place to other\r\n* You may also use the navigation with different compass modes\r\n* Check the nearest places of categories\r\n* Calculate the area of a place on the map by tapping the points\r\n* Simple app with user friendly features\r\n\r\nDisclaimer:  Please note this app will not store or upload any of user personal data.",
    "descriptionHTML": "GPS Route Maps &amp; Navigation is a simple app provided with a lot of other options. Now you can easily find directions of your path from one place to another place by clicking on the places of the map, get traffic alerts, you may also get the navigation with voice commands.<br><br>If you are in such a place that you are unaware about it and not to bother just simply our app will provides you the current address. Every routes are far away from you on a distance of single tap. You can find your easiest and fastest route between two places. You have to enter your source and destinations. <br><br>Get the fastest way to reach destination and save time by following the traffic updates. It helps you to get the accurate traffic updates. You can find the navigation directions with different compass views. You can calculate area by tapping on the map for certain area, get different modes of compass with navigations.<br><br>You can explore various neighborly places on Map like Schools ,Airports, Restaurants, Hospitals, Fuel Stations, Theaters and many more. You can also see neighborly place and location details.<br><br>GPS Route Maps &amp; Navigation provides the following features:<br><br>* Get the address of any place simply with a click<br>* Follow traffic alerts to avoid heavy routes<br>* Find the directions by clicking on two different points on map<br>* See the navigation with voice commands from place to other<br>* You may also use the navigation with different compass modes<br>* Check the nearest places of categories<br>* Calculate the area of a place on the map by tapping the points<br>* Simple app with user friendly features<br><br>Disclaimer:  Please note this app will not store or upload any of user personal data.",
